## ── ASP.NET Core ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Self-signed dev cert
*.pfx

# Published output
**/publish/
**/PublishOutput/

# EF Core migrations scaffolded SQL scripts (keep .cs migrations)
*.Designer.cs.bak

## ── SQLite database files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# But track migration snapshots
!**/Migrations/**

## ── Secrets & configuration ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ASP.NET Core secrets
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.Production.json

# User secrets store
%APPDATA%/Microsoft/UserSecrets/

# .env files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

